<title>SWEDEN: Incentive sees 360 mln skr gain on sale.</title>
<headline>Incentive sees 360 mln skr gain on sale.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment group Incentive AB said on Friday it expected a capital gain of 360 million crowns from the sale of 2.8 million Electrolux B-series shares.</p>
</text>
